        {
          "type": "h1",
          "text": "Marketing Automation\nAutomate your marketing. Not your relationships."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Marketing automation is the set-up of systems that nurture leads, onboard customers and recover lost revenue automatically through email, SMS and your CRM. Khalid Farhan is a Dublin agency that designs and builds these flows in HubSpot, Klaviyo, ActiveCampaign and similar platforms so sales teams spend time only on warm leads."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A good fit if you are"
        },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "B2B companies with leads that need weeks of follow-up",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Subscription and e-commerce businesses fighting churn",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Teams doing by hand what a sequence could do for them",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
