        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT AUTOMATION HAS DONE FOR BUSINESSES LIKE YOURS"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Real engagements, described by industry and place rather than name, because our clients would rather their competitors did not know who they work with."
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "text": "TELECOM\nDHAKA, BANGLADESH\n\n4.1M\nViews in 6 months\n\n4.1 million views for a youth data campaign\n\nA telecom operator in Bangladesh\n\nRead the case study",
          "href": "/work/case-studies/telecom-operator-bangladesh-video",
          "imgs": []
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "text": "MANUFACTURING AND RETAIL\nDHAKA, BANGLADESH\n\n+240%\nShowroom enquiries\n\nShowroom visits booked online, 240% more of them\n\nA furniture manufacturer in Bangladesh\n\nRead the case study",
          "href": "/work/case-studies/furniture-manufacturer-google-ads",
          "imgs": []
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "text": "B2B SOFTWARE\nIRELAND AND THE UK\n\n+190%\nDemo requests\n\nDemo requests up 190% and cited by AI search\n\nA workforce management SaaS\n\nRead the case study",
          "href": "/work/case-studies/workforce-saas-linkedin-ads",
          "imgs": []
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "See all 24 case studies"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "className": "svd",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT IS INCLUDED IN OUR AUTOMATION SERVICE"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Marketing automation done well feels personal, not robotic. We build automation workflows that respond to real customer behaviour — converting leads who need nurturing, recovering abandoned purchases, and delighting customers post-sale."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Retainers from €1,500 a month. Every engagement starts with a free audit, so you see the plan before you pay for anything."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Automation Architecture"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Full workflow mapping from lead capture to customer advocacy."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Lead Nurture Flows"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Multi-touch email and SMS sequences triggered by behaviour."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "E-commerce Flows"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Abandoned cart, browse abandonment, post-purchase, and win-back."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "CRM Integration"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Connecting your marketing automation with your CRM and sales tools."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Attribution"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Revenue attribution across automated flows."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Lead Scoring"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Behavioural and demographic lead scoring to prioritise sales follow-up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
