          "type": "h2",
          "text": "HOW THE FIRST 90 DAYS GO"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Days 1–30\nMap of your customer journey and the gaps in it",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Days 31–60\nLead nurture, onboarding and win-back flows built and tested",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Days 61–90\nCRM integration and reporting so you see what each flow produces",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Our approach to Automation, step by step"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "01"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "text": "Map"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "document the full customer journey from awareness to advocacy"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "02"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "text": "Identify"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "find the highest-value automation opportunities"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "03"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "text": "Build"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "set up workflows, triggers, and content"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "04"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "text": "Test"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "quality assurance across all email clients and devices"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "05"
        },
        {
          "type": "h4",
          "text": "Optimise"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A/B test messages and timing; monthly performance review"
        }
      ]
    },
